er rating 38619; Hard difficulty level 68, recommended Beyonder rating 69025; Nightmare difficulty level 70, recommended Beyonder rating 94338.\n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Order: </>Normal Drill opens on day 2 of the season, Normal Bonnie on day 4, Normal War Dragon on day 5; Hard Johnny opens on day 6, Hard Drill on day 8, Hard Bonnie on day 12, Hard War Dragon on day 14; Nightmare War Dragon opens on day 26.\n<Assistant_Title2>Challenge Instructions: </>All bosses support 5~6 player teams and offer an AI mode. Different bosses and difficulties open independently; please choose your challenge target based on your character level and recommended Beyonder rating.",
